==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Zombies here at an extremely low magnification, and thus aren't anything to fret over. Bring [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], as well as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] to dispatch the Shy Boy quickly and claim your victory.

